# OpenRouter API key — get one at https://openrouter.ai/keys
# NEVER commit a real key to version control.
#
# SECURITY WARNING: Any variable prefixed VITE_ is bundled into the
# client-side JavaScript and shipped to the browser. Anyone who opens
# devtools can read this key. This is acceptable ONLY for local/demo
# use. For a production deployment, move all OpenRouter requests behind
# a server-side proxy so the key never reaches the browser.
VITE_OPENROUTER_API_KEY=
